BT 1 0 0 1 0 27.2 Tm /F1 8.8 Tf 12 TL (This policy defines which business expenses DocumentAI will reimburse, the approval process, and the documentation) Tj T* (employees must provide. It applies to employees incurring expenses on behalf of the company. Contractors should follow the) Tj T* (terms of their agreements.) Tj T* ET
